{"id": "t093-004", "text": "Kiri and Leon have split up after six years. She told me over lunch and was surprisingly matter-of-fact about it. She's staying in the flat for now and he's gone back to his parents' place in Leeds. They're still sharing their dog Juno, which she admits is a bit awkward.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "matter-of-fact", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying in the flat", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "place in Leeds", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Juno", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit awkward", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t093-006", "text": "Dentist moved to 5/14 at 9:15. Pick up the dry cleaning on the way back.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 5/14 at 9:15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up the dry cleaning", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the way back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-008", "text": "Gareth is a huge Wrexham fan and has a season ticket. He also mentioned he's been learning Welsh on Duolingo.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Wrexham", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a season ticket", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Welsh", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t093-009", "text": "Call Rebecca back about the weekend. She wants to come and visit with the kids around May 14.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call Rebecca back about the weekend", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around May 14", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t093-010", "text": "Caitlin's engagement is off. She didn't want to talk about it much, just said they'd agreed it wasn't right. Must remember not to ask about the venue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement is off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "not to ask about the venue", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t093-012", "text": "Kaito said his redundancy meeting is on Tuesday. He's really anxious about it because they've only just bought the house and his wife is on maternity leave until June 2027. He's been told about a third of the department will go. I'd like to message him on Tuesday evening to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bought the house", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "on maternity leave", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until June 2027"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-013", "text": "Santiago, or Santi as everyone calls him, is moving back to Valencia in January 2027. Leaving drinks are on the 12th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santi", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Valencia", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t093-018", "text": "Felix said the memorial for his uncle has been pushed back to 3 April 2027 so that the family in Canada can make it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "memorial", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 3 April 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t093-021", "text": "Vanessa and her partner Andre are hosting a small get-together on 15 November 2026. Need to RSVP and ask what to bring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small get-together", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "RSVP", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask what to bring", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t093-022", "text": "Hana lost her job at the agency. Her manager told her on a video call, which she found awful. She's applying for things but feeling pretty low. I should send her that recruiter's details.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost her job at the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying for things", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that recruiter's details", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "recruiter"}]}
{"id": "t093-025", "text": "Giulia Rossi rang to say the trip to Lisbon in March 2027 is cancelled because her brother Nasser broke his leg skiing in Austria. He's having surgery on Monday and will be in a cast for at least six weeks. She's going to stay with him for a bit. Need to get the deposit back from the apartment people.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia Rossi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke his leg", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay with him", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the deposit back from the apartment people", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t093-027", "text": "Rhys's brother died very suddenly in September. Rhys is back at work but clearly struggling. He's not sleeping and has stopped going to five-a-side. He mentioned the inquest is on January 18 and that his mum is dreading it. I must make time to take him out for a pint before then, and maybe ring him on the 18th itself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "back at work", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five-a-side", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "inquest", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "January 18", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him out for a pint", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th itself", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t093-032", "text": "Joanna's leaving do is on May 30 at the Crown. She's going freelance after twelve years at the firm and seems genuinely thrilled about it. Her first client is a charity she used to volunteer for. She'd love a decent pair of headphones for the train, apparently, so a few of us might chip in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joanna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going freelance", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "first client is a charity she used to volunteer for", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent pair of headphones for the train", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t093-034", "text": "FaceTime with Kiri on Sunday at seven, her time. She's having a hard week after the breakup and just wants company.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "FaceTime", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at seven", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "having a hard week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t093-035", "text": "Leon told me his company is closing the Manchester office at the end of March 2027 and he'll probably be made redundant. He hasn't decided whether to take the package or move to London. Honestly he seems more excited than worried. He's always wanted to try running his own bike repair business, and he's already looking at a unit near the canal.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "closing the Manchester office", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "more excited than worried", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanted to try running his own bike repair business", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t093-037", "text": "Bumped into Duc and his wife at the station. Their daughter starts university in Glasgow in September, and they're driving her up on 9/14.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "university in Glasgow", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving her up", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/14", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t093-039", "text": "Blessing said thank you for the card. The service for her grandmother was beautiful, and her aunt's staying with them until the new year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "service", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with them", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the new year", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t093-042", "text": "Ryan and Heather are both coming to the quiz on Thursday. Book a table for four.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Heather", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiz", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Book a table for four", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t093-048", "text": "Long call with Ming tonight. Her father died in Kunming on October 3rd and she couldn't get a flight in time. She's going over for the hundred-day ceremony in January 2027, and her partner Felix is going with her. She said what helps most is people saying his name rather than avoiding it. Need to check in with her before she flies and maybe send something small for the altar.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "father", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died in Kunming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hundred-day ceremony", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "people saying his name rather than avoiding it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she flies", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something small for the altar", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t093-053", "text": "Chioma got onto the midwifery course. Starts September 2027. Send her a congratulations card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got onto the midwifery course", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her a congratulations card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t093-056", "text": "Aurelio's partner Catalina has just been made redundant from the hospital trust. Her last day is 12/19, right before Christmas. Aurelio says she's putting a brave face on it but he's worried. They had planned to go to Mexico in the spring, but that's on hold now. I should invite them both over for dinner sometime in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Catalina", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the hospital trust", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12/19", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "right before Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite them both over for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in December", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t093-059", "text": "Gareth called off the stag do. He said with everything going on with his dad's health it didn't feel right.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}]}
